# Parker Luck: a player with no cards in their library reveals nothing (CR 701.20), so the other player loses no life for it, while the
# empty-library player still loses life for the card revealed by the other. Bot2's seven-card deck leaves its library empty: Bot1
# reveals Sol Ring (mana value 1) and loses nothing, Bot2 loses 1 and has no card to put into its hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Parker Luck
Swamp x5
Sol Ring
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Parker Luck.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
